{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktop Town</strong> is a relaxing <strong>idle city builder</strong> that runs directly on your desktop. <strong>Build</strong>\u00a0and <strong>decorate</strong> your own tiny town, or\u00a0<strong>watch</strong> your little citizens go about their day, while doing your usual tasks on the PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 unique hand-made objects, for you to build your cozy town.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 soundtracks\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >all release-version mechanics\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your Town</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of modular blocks to design your town exactly the way you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021960/extras/a7f929f4b2c9a8d6d1a227b21676d510.poster.avif?t=1757923440\" width=956 height=606 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021960/extras/a7f929f4b2c9a8d6d1a227b21676d510.webm?t=1757923440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021960/extras/a7f929f4b2c9a8d6d1a227b21676d510.mp4?t=1757923440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add plants, lanterns, and a wide range of other decorations to bring your town to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021960/extras/da0691da91b42f1c390c75bb393091a3.poster.avif?t=1757923440\" width=956 height=606 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021960/extras/da0691da91b42f1c390c75bb393091a3.webm?t=1757923440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021960/extras/da0691da91b42f1c390c75bb393091a3.mp4?t=1757923440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When there\u2019s nothing else to do, simply watch your citizens as they wander around and go about their day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021960/extras/8bdf690d6bc8b0ae4778a013fbe42ceb.poster.avif?t=1757923440\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021960/extras/8bdf690d6bc8b0ae4778a013fbe42ceb.webm?t=1757923440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021960/extras/8bdf690d6bc8b0ae4778a013fbe42ceb.mp4?t=1757923440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4021960?t=1757923440","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021960/65b729bcfbac6b6d57199ef958b773ec0b691964/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757923440","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021960/4a59dfc0cb01b5072f1dd5ce3d4056b94b215803/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757923440","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021960/4a59dfc0cb01b5072f1dd5ce3d4056b94b215803/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757923440","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achieveme